---
title: Squire Data Flow - alert ingress to response, 3 swimlanes
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(255,232,204) Consumer
        participant N as n8n / operator
    end
    box rgb(209,250,229) Squire
        participant API as svc-squire FastAPI
        participant PG as pre_graph_pii
        participant GR as LangGraph runner
        participant NM as svc-nemo rail
        participant AN as Anthropic API
        participant TV as Tavily
    end
    box rgb(237,233,254) Data + Observability
        participant DB as svc-db pgvector
        participant LW as svc-langfuse-web
        participant LC as svc-langfuse-clickhouse
        participant LR as svc-langfuse-redis
    end

    N->>API: POST /alert (auth header)
    API->>API: Token auth check + Cloudflare rate limit
    API->>LR: increment daily cost counter
    LR-->>API: under ceiling
    API->>PG: scan raw payload (regex SSN/CC/email/phone)
    alt PII detected
        PG-->>API: PII_DETECTED_PRE_GRAPH
        API->>LW: trace write (rail_outcomes)
        LW->>LC: persist trace
        API-->>N: 400 PII_BLOCK (0ms 0 cost)
    else Clean
        PG-->>API: CLEAN
        API->>GR: invoke graph
        GR->>NM: input rail evaluate
        NM-->>GR: ALLOW
        GR->>DB: pgvector top-k retrieve
        DB-->>GR: ir_chunks
        GR->>TV: enrichment query (optional)
        TV-->>GR: search results
        GR->>AN: classify (Opus 5)
        AN-->>GR: severity
        loop critique loop max 3
            GR->>AN: draft + critique (Fable 5)
            AN-->>GR: critique result
        end
        GR->>NM: output rail scan
        NM-->>GR: masked or pass
        GR->>DB: insert squire_invocations audit row
        GR->>LW: trace write with rail_outcomes + cost + node timings
        LW->>LC: persist trace
        LW->>LR: cache invocation metadata
        GR-->>API: report
        API-->>N: 200 report + severity + citations
    end
